{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Eij84PEdyQ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> ### 5. Saccayamakaṃ ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṇṇattivāro ^6-5a-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) uddeso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5.980788\">00:05</span> 1. Cattāri saccāni – dukkhasaccaṃ, samudayasaccaṃ nirodhasaccaṃ, maggasaccaṃ. ^6-5a-1</p><p><br /></p><p> #### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-5b-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"25.380903\">00:25</span> 2. (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ? ^6-5b-2</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"31.516407\">00:31</span> (Kha) dukkhasaccaṃ dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"34.42403\">00:34</span> (Ka) samudayo samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"37.238071\">00:37</span> (Kha) samudayasaccaṃ samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"40.106967\">00:40</span> (Ka) nirodho nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"43.294006\">00:43</span> (Kha) nirodhasaccaṃ nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"45.581156\">00:45</span> (Ka) maggo maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"47.806126\">00:47</span> (Kha) maggasaccaṃ maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"52.70781\">00:52</span> 3. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccaṃ? ^6-5b-3</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"59.693906\">00:59</span> (Kha) na dukkhasaccaṃ na dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"63.095405\">01:03</span> (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"66.637778\">01:06</span> (Kha) na samudayasaccaṃ na samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"70.184181\">01:10</span> (Ka) na nirodho na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"73.627644\">01:13</span> (Kha) na nirodhasaccaṃ na nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"77.13412\">01:17</span> (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"80.0528\">01:20</span> (Kha) na maggasaccaṃ na maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"87.246628\">01:27</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-5c-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"93.049308\">01:33</span> 4. (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ? ^6-5c-4</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"99.094697\">01:39</span> (Kha) saccā samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"101.661581\">01:41</span> (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"104.335046\">01:44</span> (Kha) saccā nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"106.930929\">01:46</span> (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"109.417836\">01:49</span> (Kha) saccā maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"111.882074\">01:51</span> (Ka) samudayo samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"114.741293\">01:54</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"117.240515\">01:57</span> (Ka) samudayo samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"119.936686\">01:59</span> (Kha) saccā nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"122.881851\">02:02</span>  (Ka) samudayo samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"125.615254\">02:05</span> (Kha) saccā maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"128.030529\">02:08</span> (Ka) nirodho nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"130.763497\">02:10</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"133.175786\">02:13</span> (Ka) nirodho nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"135.693965\">02:15</span> (Kha) saccā samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"138.552269\">02:18</span> (Ka) nirodho nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"141.14736\">02:21</span> (Kha) saccā maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"143.700491\">02:23</span> (Ka) maggo maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"145.994636\">02:25</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"148.674357\">02:28</span> (Ka) maggo maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"150.967622\">02:30</span> (Kha) saccā samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"153.630485\">02:33</span> (Ka) maggo maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"156.243639\">02:36</span> (Kha) saccā nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"161.402071\">02:41</span> 5. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccaṃ? ^6-5c-5</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"168.707868\">02:48</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"172.443466\">02:52</span> (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"176.107048\">02:56</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"179.378989\">02:59</span> (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"182.750353\">03:02</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"185.79556\">03:05</span> (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"188.891249\">03:08</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"192.416444\">03:12</span> (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"195.598311\">03:15</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"198.875618\">03:18</span> (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"202.356066\">03:22</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"205.676146\">03:25</span> (Ka) na nirodho na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"213.510506\">03:33</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"216.360593\">03:36</span> (Ka) na nirodho na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"219.688137\">03:39</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"222.922952\">03:42</span> (Ka) na nirodho na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"226.454611\">03:46</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"229.466764\">03:49</span> (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"232.319083\">03:52</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"235.57429\">03:55</span> (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"238.501871\">03:58</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"241.473733\">04:01</span> (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"244.572993\">04:04</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodhasaccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Suddhasaccavāro ^6-5d-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"258.410085\">04:18</span> 6. (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccaṃ? ^6-5d-6</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"264.404338\">04:24</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"266.340041\">04:26</span> (Ka) samudayo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"268.281486\">04:28</span> (Kha) saccā samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"270.327797\">04:30</span> (Ka) nirodho saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"272.503575\">04:32</span> (Kha) saccā nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"274.475145\">04:34</span> (Ka) maggo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"276.129316\">04:36</span> (Kha) saccā maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"280.596076\">04:40</span> 7. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccaṃ? ^6-5d-7</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"287.230574\">04:47</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"289.944259\">04:49</span> (Ka) na samudayo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"292.56456\">04:52</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"295.725282\">04:55</span> (Ka) na nirodho na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"297.963395\">04:57</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"300.912845\">05:00</span> (Ka) na maggo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"303.749854\">05:03</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"312.174707\">05:12</span> #### 4. Suddhasaccamūlacakkavāro ^6-5e-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"315.522993\">05:15</span> 8. (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccaṃ? ^6-5e-8</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"320.908145\">05:20</span> (Kha) saccā samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"323.371304\">05:23</span> (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"325.023851\">05:25</span> (Kha) saccā nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"327.743121\">05:27</span> (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"329.208739\">05:29</span> (Kha) saccā maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"331.274467\">05:31</span> Samudayo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"333.611852\">05:33</span> Saccā dukkhaṃ?…Pe… saccā maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"337.896293\">05:37</span> Nirodho saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"339.979903\">05:39</span> Saccā dukkhaṃ?…Pe… saccā maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"344.7038\">05:44</span> (Ka) maggo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"347.263197\">05:47</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"349.149092\">05:49</span> (Ka) maggo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"351.505875\">05:51</span> (Kha) saccā samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"352.684711\">05:52</span> (Ka) maggo saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"355.538425\">05:55</span> (Kha) saccā nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"359.509476\">05:59</span> 9. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccaṃ? ^6-5e-9</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"366.465771\">06:06</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"369.409722\">06:09</span> (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"372.374246\">06:12</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"374.688614\">06:14</span> (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"377.726405\">06:17</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"380.242025\">06:20</span> Na samudayo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"383.467443\">06:23</span> Na saccā na dukkhaṃ?…Pe… na saccā na maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"388.923051\">06:28</span> Na nirodho na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"391.539168\">06:31</span> Na saccā na dukkhaṃ?…Pe… na saccā na maggo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"397.405197\">06:37</span> (Ka) na maggo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"400.374518\">06:40</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"402.900708\">06:42</span> (Ka) na maggo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"405.578433\">06:45</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayo?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"408.224395\">06:48</span> (Ka) na maggo na saccaṃ?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"410.742829\">06:50</span> (Kha) na saccā na nirodho?</p><p><br /></p><p>Paṇṇattiuddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Paṇṇattivāra ^6-5f-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) niddeso</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 1. Padasodhanavāro ^6-5g-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"441.863135\">07:21</span> 10. (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5g-10</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"448.747225\">07:28</span> (Kha) dukkhasaccaṃ dukkhanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"451.917017\">07:31</span> Kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ [avasesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ (syā.) evamuparipi], na dukkhaṃ. Kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ dukkhañceva dukkhasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"466.035049\">07:46</span> (Ka) samudayo samudayasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"473.407931\">07:53</span> Samudayasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso samudayo, na samudayasaccaṃ. Samudayasaccaṃ samudayo ceva samudayasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"486.113249\">08:06</span> (Kha) samudayasaccaṃ samudayoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p>  (Ka) nirodho nirodhasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"492.543101\">08:12</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso nirodho, na nirodhasaccaṃ. Nirodhasaccaṃ nirodho ceva nirodhasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"507.683635\">08:27</span> (Kha) nirodhasaccaṃ nirodhoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"512.204855\">08:32</span> (Ka) maggo maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"520.157305\">08:40</span> Maggasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso maggo, na maggasaccaṃ. Maggasaccaṃ maggo ceva maggasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"531.271172\">08:51</span> (Kha) maggasaccaṃ maggoti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"537.923827\">08:57</span> 11. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccanti? ^6-5g-11</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"545.735777\">09:05</span> Kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na dukkhaṃ [avasesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na dukkhaṃ (sī. syā. ka.) evaṃ avasesesu tīsu saccesu] dukkhasaccaṃ. Dukkhañca dukkhasaccañca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca dukkhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"561.50354\">09:21</span> (Kha) na dukkhasaccaṃ na dukkhanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"567.042767\">09:27</span> (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"577.030077\">09:37</span> (Kha) na samudayasaccaṃ na samudayoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"580.97739\">09:40</span> Samudayasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na samudayasaccaṃ, samudayo. Samudayañca samudayasaccañca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva samudayo na ca samudayasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"597.970263\">09:57</span> (Ka) na nirodho na nirodhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"605.471832\">10:05</span> (Kha) na nirodhasaccaṃ na nirodhoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"609.219645\">10:09</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na nirodhasaccaṃ, nirodho. Nirodhañca nirodhasaccañca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva nirodho na ca nirodhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"625.005034\">10:25</span> (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"634.838463\">10:34</span> (Kha) na maggasaccaṃ na maggoti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"638.028375\">10:38</span> Maggasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso na maggasaccaṃ, maggo. Maggañca maggasaccañca ṭhapetvā avaseso na ceva maggo na ca maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"657.689776\">10:57</span> #### 2. Padasodhanamūlacakkavāro ^6-5h-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"663.052237\">11:03</span>  12. (Ka) dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5h-12</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"670.262399\">11:10</span> (Kha) saccā samudayasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"673.344891\">11:13</span> Samudayasaccaṃ saccañceva samudayasaccañca. Avasesā saccā [avasesā saccā saccā (syā.)] na samudayasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"683.340414\">11:23</span> Dukkhaṃ dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"692.312179\">11:32</span> Saccā nirodhasaccanti?…Pe… saccā maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"698.472895\">11:38</span> Maggasaccaṃ saccañceva maggasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"711.104869\">11:51</span> 13. Samudayo samudayasaccanti? ^6-5h-13</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"716.865129\">11:56</span> Samudayasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso samudayo, na samudayasaccaṃ. Samudayasaccaṃ samudayo ceva samudayasaccañca. Saccā dukkhasaccanti? …Pe… saccā nirodhasaccanti?…Pe… saccā maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"737.951457\">12:17</span> Maggasaccaṃ saccañceva maggasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"747.528115\">12:27</span> 14. Nirodho nirodhasaccanti? ^6-5h-14</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"754.87436\">12:34</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso nirodho, na nirodhasaccaṃ. Nirodhasaccaṃ nirodho ceva nirodhasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"767.524719\">12:47</span> Saccā dukkhasaccanti?…Pe… saccā samudayasaccanti? …Pe… saccā maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"775.795164\">12:55</span> Maggasaccaṃ saccañceva maggasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"785.711435\">13:05</span> 15. Maggo maggasaccanti? ^6-5h-15</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"794.070986\">13:14</span> Maggasaccaṃ ṭhapetvā avaseso maggo, na maggasaccaṃ. Maggasaccaṃ maggo ceva maggasaccañca.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"804.513602\">13:24</span> Saccā dukkhasaccanti?…Pe… saccā samudayasaccanti? …Pe… saccā nirodhasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"813.288471\">13:33</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ saccañceva nirodhasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na nirodhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"825.979289\">13:45</span> 16. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccanti? ^6-5h-16</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"834.208724\">13:54</span> Kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na dukkhaṃ, dukkhasaccaṃ. Dukkhañca dukkhasaccañca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca dukkhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"851.375145\">14:11</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"856.243056\">14:16</span> Na dukkhaṃ na dukkhasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"863.860853\">14:23</span> Kāyikaṃ dukkhaṃ cetasikaṃ dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na dukkhaṃ, dukkhasaccaṃ. Dukkhañca dukkhasaccañca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca dukkhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"881.9276\">14:41</span> Na saccā na nirodhasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"890.51815\">14:50</span> 17. (Ka) na samudayo na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5h-17</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"900.919896\">15:00</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"906.252467\">15:06</span> Na samudayo na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"915.646957\">15:15</span> Na saccā na nirodhasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"925.080961\">15:25</span> 18. Na nirodho na nirodhasaccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5h-18</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"935.406513\">15:35</span> Na saccā na dukkhasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na samudayasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"948.32177\">15:48</span> 19. (Ka) na maggo na maggasaccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5h-19</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"957.568617\">15:57</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"962.953177\">16:02</span> Na maggo na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"968.237243\">16:08</span> Na saccā na samudayasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na nirodhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 3. Suddhasaccavāro ^6-5i-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"988.262673\">16:28</span> 20. (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5i-20</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"995.542291\">16:35</span> (Kha) saccā dukkhasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"998.41515\">16:38</span> Dukkhasaccaṃ saccañceva dukkhasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na dukkhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1008.301883\">16:48</span> Samudayo saccanti? Āmantā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1016.545886\">16:56</span> Nirodho saccanti? Āmantā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.640871\">17:00</span> (Ka) maggo saccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1024.673742\">17:04</span> (Kha) saccā maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1028.004984\">17:08</span> Maggasaccaṃ saccañceva maggasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1039.510896\">17:19</span> 21. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccanti? ^6-5i-21</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1046.584823\">17:26</span> Dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na dukkhaṃ, saccā. Dukkhañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesaṃ na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1060.499565\">17:40</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1068.923464\">17:48</span> Na samudayo na saccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1073.506993\">17:53</span> Samudayaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe… nirodhaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1081.486177\">18:01</span> (Ka) na maggo na saccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1084.36076\">18:04</span> Maggaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na maggo, saccā. Maggañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva maggo na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1097.813091\">18:17</span> (Kha) na saccā na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1105.937999\">18:25</span> #### 4. Suddhasaccamūlacakkavāro ^6-5j-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1111.80305\">18:31</span> 22. (Ka) dukkhaṃ saccanti? Āmantā. ^6-5j-22</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1119.612745\">18:39</span> (Kha) saccā samudayasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1122.95955\">18:42</span> Samudayasaccaṃ saccañceva samudayasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na samudayasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1132.860841\">18:52</span> Dukkhaṃ saccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1141.310158\">19:01</span> Saccā nirodhasaccanti?…Pe…. Saccā maggasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1147.356516\">19:07</span> Maggasaccaṃ saccañceva maggasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na maggasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1157.207612\">19:17</span> Samudayo saccanti? Āmantā.…Pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1165.795284\">19:25</span> Nirodho saccanti? Āmantā.…Pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1170.374998\">19:30</span> Maggo saccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1174.128895\">19:34</span> Saccā dukkhasaccanti?…Pe… saccā samudayasaccanti? …Pe… saccā nirodhasaccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1183.283667\">19:43</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ saccañceva nirodhasaccañca. Avasesā saccā na nirodhasaccaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) paccanīkaṃ</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1195.195921\">19:55</span> 23. (Ka) na dukkhaṃ na saccanti? ^6-5j-23</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1202.441473\">20:02</span> Dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na dukkhaṃ, saccā. Dukkhañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1215.443017\">20:15</span> (Kha) na saccā na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1220.556232\">20:20</span> Na dukkhaṃ na saccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1223.351865\">20:23</span> Dukkhaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na dukkhaṃ, saccā. Dukkhañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva dukkhaṃ na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1236.033211\">20:36</span> Na saccā na nirodhasaccanti?…Pe… na saccā na maggasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1245.27148\">20:45</span> 24. Na samudayo na saccanti? ^6-5j-24</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1252.996119\">20:52</span> Samudayaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na samudayo, saccā. Samudayañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva samudayo na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1266.77133\">21:06</span> Na saccā na dukkhasaccanti?…Pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1270.488392\">21:10</span> 25. Na nirodho na saccanti? ^6-5j-25</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1274.109919\">21:14</span> Nirodhaṃ ṭhapetvā…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1276.226837\">21:16</span> 26. (Ka) na maggo na saccanti? ^6-5j-26</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1278.957151\">21:18</span> Maggaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na maggo, saccā. Maggañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva maggo na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1292.338778\">21:32</span> (Kha) na saccā na dukkhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1301.136423\">21:41</span> Na maggo na saccanti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1304.687594\">21:44</span> Maggaṃ ṭhapetvā avasesā saccā na maggo, saccā. Maggañca saccañca ṭhapetvā avasesā na ceva maggo na ca saccā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1318.052709\">21:58</span> Na saccā na samudayasaccanti? Āmantā.…Pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1323.582462\">22:03</span> Na saccā na nirodhasaccanti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p> Paṇṇattiniddesavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Pavattivāro 1. uppādavāro ^6-5k-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-5l-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1359.699867\">22:39</span> 27. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? ^6-5l-27</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1368.0235\">22:48</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1392.002427\">23:12</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1404.12762\">23:24</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1413.159141\">23:33</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjati. Pañcavokāre maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1438.608565\">23:58</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1445.826714\">24:05</span> Arūpe maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Pañcavokāre maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca uppajjati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1467.304156\">24:27</span> 28. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? No. ^6-5l-28</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1480.121152\">24:40</span>  (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1489.194178\">24:49</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1491.410595\">24:51</span> 29. (Ka) yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? ^6-5l-29</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1502.342893\">25:02</span> Asaññasatte tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Catuvokāre pañcavokāre tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1521.412835\">25:21</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1526.100359\">25:26</span> (Ka) yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1538.160931\">25:38</span> Apāye asaññasatte tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjati. Avasese catuvokāre pañcavokāre tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1556.87776\">25:56</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjati tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1566.451529\">26:06</span> 30. (Ka) yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? ^6-5l-30</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1578.221905\">26:18</span> Apāye tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjati. Avasese catuvokāre pañcavokāre tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1596.259195\">26:36</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1601.142337\">26:41</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1604.074672\">26:44</span> 31. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?…Pe…. ^6-5l-31</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1622.283664\">27:02</span>  (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1632.000609\">27:12</span> 32. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5l-32</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1644.618299\">27:24</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1652.461753\">27:32</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1684.823625\">28:04</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1696.29681\">28:16</span> Arūpe maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1722.027062\">28:42</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1729.753509\">28:49</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1759.435186\">29:19</span> 33. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? ^6-5l-33</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1770.900149\">29:30</span> Maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttamaggavippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1800.561353\">30:00</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1809.396576\">30:09</span>  Taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe maggavippayuttataṇhāvippayuttacittassa [taṇhāvippayuttamaggavippayuttacittassa (sī.) evaṃ puggalokāsepi nirodhavārepi] uppādakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1843.010497\">30:43</span> 34. (Ka) yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Natthi. ^6-5l-34</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1854.66395\">30:54</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1864.871485\">31:04</span> (Ka) yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Natthi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1878.027647\">31:18</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1887.603046\">31:27</span> 35. (Ka) yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5l-35</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1901.20101\">31:41</span> (Kha) yattha vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1909.577677\">31:49</span> Apāye tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Asaññasatte tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1925.234924\">32:05</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1929.051477\">32:09</span> 36. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5l-36</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1942.104915\">32:22</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1950.42692\">32:30</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1985.93719\">33:05</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1997.53935\">33:17</span> Arūpe maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2025.850974\">33:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2034.804027\">33:54</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2067.170283\">34:27</span> 37. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? ^6-5l-37</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2079.295434\">34:39</span> Maggassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttamaggavippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2111.022782\">35:11</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2119.145691\">35:19</span> Taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe maggavippayuttataṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (2) Atītavāro ^6-5m-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2160.728882\">36:00</span> 38. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5m-38</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2173.880681\">36:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2183.923208\">36:23</span>  (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2194.745807\">36:34</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2213.838157\">36:53</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe… uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2220.631369\">37:00</span> 39. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? ^6-5m-39</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2232.638501\">37:12</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2250.76534\">37:30</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe… uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2268.12968\">37:48</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2260.330126\">37:40</span> 40. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha…pe…. ^6-5m-40</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2271.242862\">37:51</span>  </span><span>(Yatthakampi sabbattha sadisaṃ. Tantinānākaraṇaṃ heṭṭhā yatthakasadisaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timesta