anti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (4) Paccuppannātītavāro ^6-5o-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3373.965416\">56:13</span> 58. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5o-58</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3383.340231\">56:23</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3390.892056\">56:30</span>  Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjittha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3419.954133\">56:59</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? Anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3457.674559\">57:37</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3464.50979\">57:44</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca uppajjittha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3494.190167\">58:14</span> 59. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-59</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3505.066938\">58:25</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3527.326729\">58:47</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3534.818405\">58:54</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca uppajjittha samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3562.417092\">59:22</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3566.243736\">59:26</span> 60. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati…pe… <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3575.098338\">59:35</span> (yatthakā sadisā sabbe). ^6-5o-60</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3572.248702\">59:32</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3582.473186\">59:42</span> 61. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-61</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3593.701047\">59:53</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa [uppatticittassa (syā.)] uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Itaresaṃ catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3626.356209\">1:00:26</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3635.228633\">1:00:35</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjittha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3669.316291\">1:01:09</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3680.875731\">1:01:20</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3718.186881\">1:01:58</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3725.808877\">1:02:05</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjittha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3758.496686\">1:02:38</span> 62. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-62</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3770.867586\">1:02:50</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3793.61862\">1:03:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3802.662327\">1:03:22</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjittha samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3833.124056\">1:03:53</span> 63. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-63</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3844.892345\">1:04:04</span> Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3846.244602\">1:04:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti? Natthi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3855.382663\">1:04:15</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3866.452773\">1:04:26</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3896.809382\">1:04:56</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3903.926246\">1:05:03</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjittha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3930.457799\">1:05:30</span> 64. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-64</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3941.333181\">1:05:41</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3973.604151\">1:06:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3981.035299\">1:06:21</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjittha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4011.1573\">1:06:51</span> 65. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati…pe…. ^6-5o-65</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4018.036097\">1:06:58</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4021.060216\">1:07:01</span> 66. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-66</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4032.380216\">1:07:12</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4066.726418\">1:07:46</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4075.308539\">1:07:55</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjittha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4105.149746\">1:08:25</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4115.21457\">1:08:35</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4153.870682\">1:09:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4162.06912\">1:09:22</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjittha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4204.310927\">1:10:04</span> 67. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? ^6-5o-67</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4216.27012\">1:10:16</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4252.573774\">1:10:52</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4263.458477\">1:11:03</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjittha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4301.78755\">1:11:41</span> #### (5) Paccuppannānāgatavāro ^6-5p-0</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4308.63504\">1:11:48</span> 68. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-68</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4318.206013\">1:11:58</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4351.895139\">1:12:31</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4359.830488\">1:12:39</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4392.555121\">1:13:12</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4399.151997\">1:13:19</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4445.77719\">1:14:05</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4452.613796\">1:14:12</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4511.11156\">1:15:11</span> 69. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-69</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4518.449479\">1:15:18</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4545.062012\">1:15:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4553.042206\">1:15:53</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye [paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye (sī. syā.) puggalokāsavārepi] caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca uppajjissati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4595.974368\">1:16:35</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4599.074347\">1:16:39</span> 70. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati…pe… </p><p><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4608.744195\">1:16:48</span> (yatthakampi yassayatthakasadisaṃ kātabbaṃ). ^6-5p-70</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4605.902728\">1:16:45</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4613.276173\">1:16:53</span> 71. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-71</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4624.522023\">1:17:04</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4665.780733\">1:17:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4674.056402\">1:17:54</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4708.112519\">1:18:28</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4720.331294\">1:18:40</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4771.838872\">1:19:31</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4780.256979\">1:19:40</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4835.096321\">1:20:35</span> 72. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-72</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4842.646794\">1:20:42</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4871.354469\">1:21:11</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4879.673687\">1:21:19</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjissati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4922.482276\">1:22:02</span> 73. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-73</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4932.994571\">1:22:12</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4975.07851\">1:22:55</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4982.20915\">1:23:02</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5029.19144\">1:23:49</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5039.896893\">1:23:59</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5090.927235\">1:24:50</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5098.249656\">1:24:58</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5147.672498\">1:25:47</span> 74. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-74</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5158.641476\">1:25:58</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissānti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5211.680681\">1:26:51</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5219.492262\">1:26:59</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ maggasaccañca nuppajjissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5261.074875\">1:27:41</span> 75. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati…pe…. ^6-5p-75</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5268.424156\">1:27:48</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5271.51391\">1:27:51</span> 76. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-76</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5282.666161\">1:28:02</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5328.666631\">1:28:48</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5337.557232\">1:28:57</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5389.437644\">1:29:49</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5401.197361\">1:30:01</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññattā cavantānaṃ arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5456.904435\">1:30:56</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5465.144464\">1:31:05</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5524.133148\">1:32:04</span> 77. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? ^6-5p-77</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5536.717869\">1:32:16</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ, āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5582.349656\">1:33:02</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5590.316983\">1:33:10</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (6) Atītānāgatavāro ^6-5q-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5642.421116\">1:34:02</span> 78. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5q-78</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5650.524231\">1:34:10</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha samudayasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5673.276913\">1:34:33</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5682.263271\">1:34:42</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5693.320586\">1:34:53</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5725.481218\">1:35:25</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5730.293609\">1:35:30</span> 79. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti, ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjissati. ^6-5q-79</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5769.603043\">1:36:09</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5774.37722\">1:36:14</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5776.7932\">1:36:16</span> 80. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha…pe…. ^6-5q-80</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5784.312174\">1:36:24</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5786.91879\">1:36:26</span> 81. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5q-81</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5798.705359\">1:36:38</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha samudayasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5827.052896\">1:37:07</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5835.361828\">1:37:15</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5858.234226\">1:37:38</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5869.569567\">1:37:49</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5907.539534\">1:38:27</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5915.638721\">1:38:35</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5944.304787\">1:39:04</span> 82. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti? ^6-5q-82</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5955.88453\">1:39:15</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjittha maggasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5991.472168\">1:39:51</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5999.876683\">1:39:59</span>  Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjittha. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca uppajjissati samudayasaccañca uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6033.600806\">1:40:33</span> 83. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? Natthi. ^6-5q-83</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6044.990972\">1:40:44</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p> Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? Natthi.</p><p><br /></p><p> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p> <span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6057.179393\">1:40:57</span> 84. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? Natthi. ^6-5q-84</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6066.820944\">1:41:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6076.249559\">1:41:16</span> ##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6082.16917\">1:41:22</span> 85. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjittha…pe…. ^6-5q-85</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6086.15208\">1:41:26</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6088.905403\">1:41:28</span> 86. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? Uppajjissati. ^6-5q-86</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6102.938156\">1:41:42</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6112.77784\">1:41:52</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? Uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6126.5762\">1:42:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti? Uppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6136.964279\">1:42:16</span> 87. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti? ^6-5q-87</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6149.44466\">1:42:29</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjittha maggasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6170.055054\">1:42:50</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6178.560085\">1:42:58</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjittha. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nuppajjissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>Uppādavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Pavatti 2. nirodhavāro ^6-5r-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-5s-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6235.636889\">1:43:55</span> 88. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? ^6-5s-88</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6244.082184\">1:44:04</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati samudayasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6268.269348\">1:44:28</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6277.870186\">1:44:37</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6288.885641\">1:44:48</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Pañcavokāre maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6314.68485\">1:45:14</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6321.894532\">1:45:21</span> Arūpe maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Pañcavokāre maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6343.847827\">1:45:43</span> 89. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-5s-89</p><p><br /></p><p>(Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6359.929912\">1:45:59</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6363.315103\">1:46:03</span> 90. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? ^6-5s-90</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6374.540356\">1:46:14</span> Asaññasatte tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6381.93528\">1:46:21</span> (Yatthakaṃ uppādepi nirodhepi uppādanirodhepi sadisaṃ, natthi nānākaraṇaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6379.018706\">1:46:19</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6395.74041\">1:46:35</span> 91. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5s-91</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6407.184855\">1:46:47</span> (Yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6419.006105\">1:46:59</span> 92. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5s-92</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6430.255999\">1:47:10</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6438.602544\">1:47:18</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6475.811247\">1:47:55</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6484.898296\">1:48:04</span> Arūpe maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6512.812469\">1:48:32</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6520.554046\">1:48:40</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe phalassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6549.690162\">1:49:09</span> 93. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti? ^6-5s-93</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6561.091084\">1:49:21</span> Maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttamaggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6592.946375\">1:49:52</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6600.768284\">1:50:00</span> Taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe maggavippayuttataṇhāvippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6632.400799\">1:50:32</span> ##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6635.766419\">1:50:35</span> 94. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5s-94</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6643.073979\">1:50:43</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6646.729055\">1:50:46</span> 95. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5s-95</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6660.532693\">1:51:00</span> (Yassakampi [yassakampi yatthakampi (sī. syā.)] yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ, yassayatthakepi nirodhasamāpannānanti cetaṃ na kātabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (2) Atītavāro ^6-5t-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6681.675601\">1:51:21</span> 96. Yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5t-96</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6696.711455\">1:51:36</span> (Yathā uppādavāre atītā pucchā anulomampi paccanīkampi vibhattā evaṃ nirodhepi vibhajitabbā, natthi nānākaraṇaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (3) Anāgatavāro ^6-5u-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6720.808643\">1:52:00</span> 97. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5u-97</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6730.070014\">1:52:10</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti [paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe (sī. syā.) uppādavāre pana pāṭhantaraṃ natthi] tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6757.726433\">1:52:37</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6762.762501\">1:52:42</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6774.506985\">1:52:54</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhissati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6807.155996\">1:53:27</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…. Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6811.775833\">1:53:31</span> 98. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5u-98</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6823.396263\">1:53:43</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6845.811144\">1:54:05</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6853.523101\">1:54:13</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6883.012051\">1:54:43</span> 99. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati…pe…. ^6-5u-99</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6890.306873\">1:54:50</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6893.692376\">1:54:53</span> 100. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5u-100</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6904.933636\">1:55:04</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6944.318319\">1:55:44</span> (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6949.479018\">1:55:49</span> 101. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5u-101</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6963.056643\">1:56:03</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"6972.623611\">1:56:12</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Pacchimacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7001.988139\">1:56:41</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7015.388328\">1:56:55</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7023.334827\">1:57:03</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Pacchimacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7050.942371\">1:57:30</span> 102. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5u-102</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7063.384465\">1:57:43</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7093.193722\">1:58:13</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7101.514494\">1:58:21</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7129.578506\">1:58:49</span> 103. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati…pe…. ^6-5u-103</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7133.856004\">1:58:53</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7136.877176\">1:58:56</span> 104. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5u-104</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7151.419437\">1:59:11</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7160.651015\">1:59:20</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Pacchimacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7192.875234\">1:59:52</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7205.942951\">2:00:05</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7216.944304\">2:00:16</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Pacchimacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7249.735498\">2:00:49</span> 105. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5u-105</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7263.409802\">2:01:03</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7296.011174\">2:01:36</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7305.386753\">2:01:45</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (4) Paccuppannātītavāro ^6-5v-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7344.691008\">2:02:24</span> 106. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5v-106</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7354.912878\">2:02:34</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7362.684626\">2:02:42</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7395.23643\">2:03:15</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7406.034069\">2:03:26</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7433.411825\">2:03:53</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7441.198909\">2:04:01</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7473.601326\">2:04:33</span> 107. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-107</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7486.394102\">2:04:46</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7510.757984\">2:05:10</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7518.521812\">2:05:18</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7548.868458\">2:05:48</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7551.40913\">2:05:51</span> 108. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5v-108</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7559.223936\">2:05:59</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7561.391404\">2:06:01</span> 109. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-109</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7573.826644\">2:06:13</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Itaresaṃ catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7605.974625\">2:06:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7614.712672\">2:06:54</span> Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7650.833729\">2:07:30</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7663.215136\">2:07:43</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7699.676157\">2:08:19</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7707.613225\">2:08:27</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7741.998413\">2:09:01</span> 110. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-110</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7754.495973\">2:09:14</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7779.605236\">2:09:39</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7788.372822\">2:09:48</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7821.919386\">2:10:21</span> 111. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha. ^6-5v-111</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7836.250931\">2:10:36</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti? Natthi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7846.451476\">2:10:46</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7857.847689\">2:10:57</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7892.40027\">2:11:32</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7899.882168\">2:11:39</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7929.035433\">2:12:09</span> 112. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-112</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7940.748947\">2:12:20</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7979.527089\">2:12:59</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7987.64979\">2:13:07</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8026.348685\">2:13:46</span> 113. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5v-113</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8031.52089\">2:13:51</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8034.394645\">2:13:54</span> 114. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-114</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8047.751738\">2:14:07</span> Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8085.747671\">2:14:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8095.181378\">2:14:55</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8128.531241\">2:15:28</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8140.700667\">2:15:40</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8184.408131\">2:16:24</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8193.004752\">2:16:33</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ upapatticittassa uppādakkhaṇe anabhisametāvīnaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8241.465296\">2:17:21</span> 115. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? ^6-5v-115</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8255.314308\">2:17:35</span> Abhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8297.295338\">2:18:17</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8309.202825\">2:18:29</span> Anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne anabhisametāvīnaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8351.942604\">2:19:11</span> #### (5) Paccuppannānāgatavāro ^6-5w-0</p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>  </span><span>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8360.682758\">2:19:20</span> 116. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-116</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8367.897518\">2:19:27</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8402.303885\">2:20:02</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8409.534067\">2:20:09</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8440.779483\">2:20:40</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8452.344661\">2:20:52</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8503.807828\">2:21:43</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8511.932589\">2:21:51</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8566.604256\">2:22:46</span> 117. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-117</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8578.251739\">2:22:58</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8604.884832\">2:23:24</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8612.688771\">2:23:32</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8661.380862\">2:24:21</span> 118. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5w-118</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8667.866958\">2:24:27</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8673.181649\">2:24:33</span> 119. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-119</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8682.430093\">2:24:42</span>  Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8723.002866\">2:25:23</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8736.660468\">2:25:36</span> Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8771.451711\">2:26:11</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8783.626881\">2:26:23</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8834.648037\">2:27:14</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8843.039717\">2:27:23</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8900.591238\">2:28:20</span> 120. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-120</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8912.159565\">2:28:32</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8946.986566\">2:29:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8955.042163\">2:29:15</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9001.66683\">2:30:01</span> 121. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-121</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9013.155755\">2:30:13</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9059.588644\">2:30:59</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9067.827566\">2:31:07</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9119.218023\">2:31:59</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9128.421202\">2:32:08</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9190.891041\">2:33:10</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9198.713694\">2:33:18</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9248.915657\">2:34:08</span> 122. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-122</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9259.063298\">2:34:19</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9318.752675\">2:35:18</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9327.095646\">2:35:27</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne [vattamāne, nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ (sī. syā.)] tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9371.729626\">2:36:11</span> 123. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati…pe…. ^6-5w-123</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9378.767734\">2:36:18</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9381.532481\">2:36:21</span> 124. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-124</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9393.277505\">2:36:33</span> Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9445.382412\">2:37:25</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9454.198834\">2:37:34</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9510.267815\">2:38:30</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9523.348468\">2:38:43</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9591.007482\">2:39:51</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9603.130275\">2:40:03</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca bhaṅgakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9662.775332\">2:41:02</span> 125. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5w-125</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9675.355452\">2:41:15</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9732.760242\">2:42:12</span>  (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9742.388857\">2:42:22</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhiti.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (6) Atītānāgatavāro ^6-5x-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9800.972062\">2:43:20</span>  126. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5x-126</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9809.971857\">2:43:29</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9835.66282\">2:43:55</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9840.441025\">2:44:00</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9851.342028\">2:44:11</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9885.878296\">2:44:45</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9890.857475\">2:44:50</span> 127. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5x-127</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9903.202546\">2:45:03</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9939.062676\">2:45:39</span>  (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9944.565558\">2:45:44</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9947.157275\">2:45:47</span> 128. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha…pe…. ^6-5x-128</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9955.365355\">2:45:55</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9959.281944\">2:45:59</span> 129. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5x-129</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9970.297571\">2:46:10</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"9998.514001\">2:46:38</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10006.865837\">2:46:46</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10032.957531\">2:47:12</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10045.412241\">2:47:25</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10085.370642\">2:48:05</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10093.229807\">2:48:13</span> Suddhāvāsaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10124.047775\">2:48:44</span> 130. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5x-130</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10136.434412\">2:48:56</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10173.776004\">2:49:33</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10182.078456\">2:49:42</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhittha. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10219.098552\">2:50:19</span> 131. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Natthi. ^6-5x-131</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10231.944735\">2:50:31</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10242.441329\">2:50:42</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Natthi.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10255.866083\">2:50:55</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10266.13259\">2:51:06</span> 132. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Natthi. ^6-5x-132</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10279.304399\">2:51:19</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10292.504906\">2:51:32</span> 133. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha…pe…. ^6-5x-133</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10299.981196\">2:51:39</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10303.887671\">2:51:43</span> 134. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Nirujjhissati. ^6-5x-134</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10316.537191\">2:51:56</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10330.127591828339\">2:52:10</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10343.094131\">2:52:23</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti? Nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10353.594844\">2:52:33</span> 135. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5x-135</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10366.003542\">2:52:46</span> Suddhāvāsānaṃ dutiye citte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhittha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10388.518567\">2:53:08</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10398.596434\">2:53:18</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti āpāyikānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhittha. Asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10443.75368\">2:54:03</span> Nirodhavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Pavatti </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10454.08797\">2:54:14</span> 3. uppādanirodhavāro ^6-5y-0</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (1) Paccuppannavāro ^6-5z-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10459.116811\">2:54:19</span> 136. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-5z-136</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10468.655398\">2:54:28</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10476.310593\">2:54:36</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10487.573139\">2:54:47</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10495.496532\">2:54:55</span> 137. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-5z-137</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10506.519668\">2:55:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10514.535622\">2:55:14</span> ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10517.251142\">2:55:17</span> 138. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? ^6-5z-138</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10526.202131\">2:55:26</span>  Asaññasatte tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhati…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10537.833358\">2:55:37</span>  (Yatthakaṃ uppādavārepi nirodhavārepi uppādanirodhavārepi sadisaṃ natthi nānākaraṇaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10534.85279\">2:55:34</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10552.239599\">2:55:52</span> 139. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhatīti? No. ^6-5z-139</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10567.624944\">2:56:07</span>  (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10574.539769\">2:56:14</span> 140. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti? ^6-5z-140</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10585.024753\">2:56:25</span> Taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10615.441375\">2:56:55</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10623.666692\">2:57:03</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte taṇhāvippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10659.017637\">2:57:39</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10667.823691\">2:57:47</span> Maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10696.634655\">2:58:16</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10704.092892\">2:58:24</span> Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10741.118694\">2:59:01</span> 141. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhatīti? ^6-5z-141</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10748.781345\">2:59:08</span> Maggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati. Taṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10778.048031\">2:59:38</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10785.923529\">2:59:45</span> Taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Maggavippayuttacittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacittassa uppādakkhaṇe nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10815.522345\">3:00:15</span> ##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10818.420528\">3:00:18</span> 142. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati…pe…. ^6-5z-142</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10825.258203\">3:00:25</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10828.894775\">3:00:28</span> 143. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati…pe…. ^6-5z-143</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10839.603982\">3:00:39</span> (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ, yassayatthakepi nirodhasamāpannānanti na kātabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (2) Atītavāro ^6-5{-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10861.932185\">3:01:01</span> 144. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5{-144</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10871.888015\">3:01:11</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10879.343526\">3:01:19</span> (Atītā pucchā yathā uppādavāre vibhattā evaṃ uppādanirodhavārepi anulomampi paccanīkampi vibhajitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (3) Anāgatavāro ^6-5|-0</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10902.085505\">3:01:42</span> 145. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5|-145</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10910.216015\">3:01:50</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjissati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10936.057706\">3:02:16</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10940.911829\">3:02:20</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10951.293834\">3:02:31</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjissati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10986.100539\">3:03:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"10990.670203\">3:03:10</span> 146. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5|-146</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11001.516953\">3:03:21</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjissati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11023.12632\">3:03:43</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11031.713657\">3:03:51</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca uppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11060.713329\">3:04:20</span> 147. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati…pe…. ^6-5|-147</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11068.134294\">3:04:28</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11071.884417\">3:04:31</span> 148. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5|-148</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11083.369207\">3:04:43</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha …pe… itaresaṃ catuvokārānaṃ pañcavokārānaṃ tesaṃ tattha…pe…. </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11119.524035\">3:05:19</span> (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11128.070046\">3:05:28</span> 149. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5|-149</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11141.640781\">3:05:41</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11149.804193\">3:05:49</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgīnaṃ arahantānaṃ yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Pacchimacittasamaṅgīnaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11176.785193\">3:06:16</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11190.040192\">3:06:30</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11198.213792\">3:06:38</span> Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Pacchimacittasamaṅgīnaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11225.136655\">3:07:05</span> 150. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5|-150</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11236.214977\">3:07:16</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11264.829803\">3:07:44</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11273.675892\">3:07:53</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11297.186958\">3:08:17</span> ##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11299.82025\">3:08:19</span> 151. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati…pe…. ^6-5|-151</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11319.630306\">3:08:39</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11312.300254\">3:08:32</span> 152. Yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjissati…pe…. ^6-5|-152</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11322.959866\">3:08:42</span> (Yassakampi yassayatthakampi sadisaṃ, samudayasaccaṃ maggasaccaṃ nānākaraṇaṃ, aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe, arahantānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjissati).</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (4) Paccuppannātītavāro ^6-5}-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11371.511058\">3:09:31</span> ##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11359.924766\">3:09:19</span> 153. Yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5}-153</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11369.618028\">3:09:29</span> Yassa vā pana…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11374.480862\">3:09:34</span> (Paccuppannaatītā [paccuppannenātītā (syā.)] pucchā uppādavārepi uppādanirodhavārepi yassakampi yatthakampi yassayatthakampi anulomampi paccanīkampi sadisaṃ, asammohantena vibhajitabbā).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11397.55558\">3:09:57</span> #### (5) Paccuppannānāgatavāro ^6-5~-0</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11407.248894\">3:10:07</span> 154. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-154</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11417.242032\">3:10:17</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Itaresaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11454.362794\">3:10:54</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11461.599\">3:11:01</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Sabbesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11494.473972\">3:11:34</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11505.164988\">3:11:45</span> Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11551.259766\">3:12:31</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11561.824392\">3:12:41</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11617.749366\">3:13:37</span> 155. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-155</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11627.399194\">3:13:47</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11654.46924\">3:14:14</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11662.310623\">3:14:22</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11707.023977\">3:15:07</span>  ##### (Kha) anulomaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11711.632031\">3:15:11</span> 156. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati…pe…. ^6-5~-156</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11717.736477\">3:15:17</span> ##### (Ga) anulomapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11720.365122\">3:15:20</span> 157. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-157</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11732.63345\">3:15:32</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ…pe… itaresaṃ catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ…pe….</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11771.468866\">3:16:11</span>  (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11780.645158\">3:16:20</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Catuvokāraṃ pañcavokāraṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11818.480011\">3:16:58</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11830.051544\">3:17:10</span> Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11887.113165\">3:18:07</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11895.274325\">3:18:15</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjati. Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11957.693836\">3:19:17</span> 158. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-158</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11969.708176\">3:19:29</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca uppajjati maggasaccañca nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12001.496582\">3:20:01</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12009.829515\">3:20:09</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ uppajjati. Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca uppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12054.725032\">3:20:54</span> ##### (Gha) paccanīkapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12058.30559\">3:20:58</span> 159. (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-159</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12070.552848\">3:21:10</span> Sabbesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12116.626246\">3:21:56</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12124.238659\">3:22:04</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12176.015121\">3:22:56</span> (Ka) yassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12187.737014\">3:23:07</span>  Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggaphalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12246.695818\">3:24:06</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12254.71918\">3:24:14</span> Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggaphalassa uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12305.706587\">3:25:05</span> 160. (Ka) yassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-160</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12316.893463\">3:25:16</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne nirodhasamāpannānaṃ asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12308.035642\">3:25:08</span>  (Kha) yassa vā pana maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12370.018705\">3:26:10</span> Ye puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12413.277797\">3:26:53</span> ##### (Ṅa) paccanīkaokāso</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12419.454941\">3:26:59</span> 161. Yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati…pe…. ^6-5~-161</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12424.37215\">3:27:04</span> ##### (Ca) paccanīkapuggalokāsā</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12427.046249\">3:27:07</span> 162. (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-162</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12439.846023\">3:27:19</span> Catuvokārā pañcavokārā cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12490.975058\">3:28:10</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12499.369222\">3:28:19</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggamaggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12557.83276\">3:29:17</span> (Ka) yassa yattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12574.198534\">3:29:34</span> Yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tassa cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe maggassa ca phalassa ca uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggaphalassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā [apāyā asaññasattā (syā.)] cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12635.669846\">3:30:35</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12644.191337\">3:30:44</span> Arahantānaṃ cittassa uppādakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ upapajjantānaṃ pavatte cittassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattaṃ [apāyaṃ asaññasattaṃ (syā.)] upapajjantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha dukkhasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ cavantānaṃ pavatte cittassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arūpe aggaphalassa uppādakkhaṇe asaññasattā cavantānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati dukkhasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12705.83133\">3:31:45</span> 163. (Ka) yassa yattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati tassa tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5~-163</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12718.714504\">3:31:58</span> Aggamaggassa uppādakkhaṇe yassa cittassa anantarā aggamaggaṃ paṭilabhissanti ye caññe maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati, no ca tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccañca nuppajjati maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12777.42512\">3:32:57</span> (Kha) yassa vā pana yattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati tassa tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12791.871849\">3:33:11</span> Āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya uppādakkhaṇe tesaṃ tattha maggasaccaṃ na nirujjhissati, no ca tesaṃ tattha samudayasaccaṃ nuppajjati. Aggamaggassa bhaṅgakkhaṇe arahantānaṃ āpāyikānaṃ ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti tesaṃ taṇhāya bhaṅgakkhaṇe taṇhāvippayuttacitte vattamāne asaññasattānaṃ tesaṃ tattha maggasaccañca na nirujjhissati samudayasaccañca nuppajjati.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### (6) Atītānāgatavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p>##### (Ka) anulomapuggalo</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12849.290139\">3:34:09</span> 164. Yassa dukkhasaccaṃ uppajjittha tassa samudayasaccaṃ nirujjhissatīti? ^6-5-164</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12860.529648\">3:34:20</span> (Yathā nirodhavāre atītānāgatā [atītenānāgatā (syā.)] pucchā anulomampi paccanīkampi vibhattā evaṃ uppādanirodhavārepi asammohantena vibhajitabbaṃ).</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12882.06725\">3:34:42</span> Uppādanirodhavāro.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12889.63995\">3:34:49</span> Pavattivāro niṭṭhito.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12897.503906\">3:34:57</span> #### 3. Pariññāvāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p>  #### 1. Paccuppannavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12910.618196\">3:35:10</span> 165. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ pajahatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5-165</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12920.375691\">3:35:20</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ pajahati so dukkhasaccaṃ parijānātīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12929.644923\">3:35:29</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12942.82023\">3:35:42</span> (Kha) yo vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p>#### 2. Atītavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12961.430259\">3:36:01</span> 166. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānittha so samudayasaccaṃ pajahitthāti? Āmantā. ^6-5-166</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12972.094956\">3:36:12</span> (Kha) yo vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12981.665758\">3:36:21</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānittha so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahitthāti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12995.58513\">3:36:35</span> (Kha) yo vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13007.745761\">3:36:47</span> #### 3. Anāgatavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13013.285141\">3:36:53</span> 167. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānissati so samudayasaccaṃ pajahissatīti? Āmantā. ^6-5-167</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13025.305888\">3:37:05</span> (Kha) yo vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13034.534834\">3:37:14</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānissati so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissatīti? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13048.267097\">3:37:28</span> (Kha) yo vā pana…pe…? Āmantā.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13058.55461\">3:37:38</span> #### 4. Paccuppannātītavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13065.617913\">3:37:45</span> 168. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ pajahitthāti? No. ^6-5-168</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13077.407674\">3:37:57</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ pajahittha so dukkhasaccaṃ parijānātīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13086.291418\">3:38:06</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13098.665022\">3:38:18</span> Arahā dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti, no ca samudayasaccaṃ nappajahittha. Aggamaggasamaṅgiñca arahantañca ṭhapetvā avasesā puggalā dukkhasaccañca na parijānanti samudayasaccañca nappajahittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13119.245379\">3:38:39</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nappajahittha so dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānātīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13127.335851\">3:38:47</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgī samudayasaccaṃ nappajahittha, no ca dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti. Aggamaggasamaṅgiñca arahantañca ṭhapetvā avasesā puggalā samudayasaccañca nappajahittha dukkhasaccañca na parijānanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13149.554007\">3:39:09</span> #### 5. Paccuppannānāgatavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13157.338726\">3:39:17</span> 169. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ pajahissatīti? No. ^6-5-169</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13168.382544\">3:39:28</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ pajahissati so dukkhasaccaṃ parijānātīti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13178.709115\">3:39:38</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13190.053719\">3:39:50</span> Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti te dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānanti, no ca samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissanti. Arahā ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te dukkhasaccañca na parijānanti samudayasaccañca nappajahissanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13213.34857\">3:40:13</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissati so dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānātīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13221.957928\">3:40:21</span> Aggamaggasamaṅgī samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissati, no ca dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānāti. Arahā ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te samudayasaccañca nappajahissanti dukkhasaccañca na parijānanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13243.67126\">3:40:43</span> #### 6. Atītānāgatavāro ^6-5-0</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13251.856199\">3:40:51</span> 170. (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ parijānittha so samudayasaccaṃ pajahissatīti? No. ^6-5-170</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13264.235687\">3:41:04</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ pajahissati so dukkhasaccaṃ parijānitthāti? No.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13273.015055\">3:41:13</span> (Ka) yo dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānittha so samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissatīti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13284.97761\">3:41:24</span> Ye maggaṃ paṭilabhissanti te dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānittha, no ca te samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissanti. Aggamaggasamaṅgī ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te dukkhasaccañca na parijānittha samudayasaccañca nappajahissanti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13309.014494\">3:41:49</span> (Kha) yo vā pana samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissati so dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānitthāti?</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13313.663087\">3:41:53</span> Arahā samudayasaccaṃ nappajahissati, no ca dukkhasaccaṃ na parijānittha. Aggamaggasamaṅgī ye ca puthujjanā maggaṃ na paṭilabhissanti te samudayasaccañca nappajahissanti dukkhasaccañca na parijānittha.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13339.366704\">3:42:19</span> Pariññāvāro.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13357.225951\">3:42:37</span>  Saccayamakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p><p><br /></p><p>Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa</p><p><br /></p>","media":"","media-source":"","media-time":""}